CORE
casts_away_const.cpp
--cpp11
^EXIT=(1|6)$
^SIGNAL=0$
type mismatch on static_cast
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [expr.static.cast]/1: the array-to-pointer conversion of a reference
to an array of const char gives `const char *'; static_cast to `char *'
would cast away constness and is ill-formed.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 reject
the program, as the front end must.
